            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Leandro Andrade filed a petition for review to the California Supreme Court, which was denied, and subsequently filed a state habeas corpus petition based on Romero."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Rehnquist",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "95f63d2e0fc8b22cb636669883d117e08df384973661a307663cad0f08d82dbf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-95f63d2e0fc8-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Rehnquist, the Court considered whether this is the first Ninth Circuit case to decide the constitutional question and then decide whether the State court had reasonably applied it."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "95f63d2e0fc8b22cb636669883d117e08df384973661a307663cad0f08d82dbf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-95f63d2e0fc8-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, a question was raised about whether an inference of gross disproportionality should be drawn in this case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Danzig",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "95f63d2e0fc8b22cb636669883d117e08df384973661a307663cad0f08d82dbf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-95f63d2e0fc8-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The discussion included whether the entire criminal record can be considered in a proportionality analysis."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "95f63d2e0fc8b22cb636669883d117e08df384973661a307663cad0f08d82dbf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-95f63d2e0fc8-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, the Court was asked whether any decision has struck down a term of years as disproportionate, noting that Solem involved a life sentence."
      }
    ],
